    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it break and release the burden\"... what does that even mean? it just sounds like nothing matters anymore. everything i try to do just makes me feel more hollow. i feel like i've been fighting a war that i've already lost, and i'm just too exhausted to even care about the outcome. is it even normal to feel like you just want everything to stop?",
